<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/rorid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Research Organization Registry (ROR) identifier](https://ror.org/about/) is a unique identifier for research and funding organization, typically expressed in its preferred URI form such as `https://ror.org/02mhbdp94`."@en .
